<title>INDIA: INDIAN MAY CEMENT OUTPUT RISES TO 7.58 MLN TONNES.</title>
<headline>INDIAN MAY CEMENT OUTPUT RISES TO 7.58 MLN TONNES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian cement production rose in May to 7.58 million tonnes from 6.48 million in the same month in 1996, the government said in its monthly economic report on Monday.</p>
<p>    CEMENT PRODUCTION    MAY 97	MAY 96	  Apr-MAY</p>
<p>							     1997/98  1996/97</p>
<p>				 7,580	  6,480     13,620  12,830</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
</text>
